# Agent tooling directories. `prisma generate` recreates these on every run (seen at PH-0.6),
# so deleting them by hand is not a fix. Matched at any depth, not just the repository root.
#
# If project-level agent config is ever wanted as a committed artifact, add a negation for the
# specific file — e.g. `!.claude/settings.json` — rather than removing these lines.
